  "details": "For one of my avatars, I have it so that when I'm in a \"prone\" state, the 'locomotion control' behaviour is disabled.\nIn the new menu update beta, when I enter into that state, I can't unprone once the 'locomotion controls' are disabled when playing on desktop with a keyboard or gamepad.\nHowever, in the current live branch (Build 1231), I can get out of prone with the C and Z buttons (or right stick on gamepad) just fine!",
